# The earlier site's supplied 3D asset packs (a camp and a horse), kept only
# on the machine they were supplied to: their licence was never resolved, so
# they were never committed, and the site no longer uses them.
assets/camp-source/
assets/horse-source/

# The sources the title cards' silhouettes are baked from: the rider
# photograph (Unsplash) and the full-size public-domain Remington scan
# (6.5MB, fetched from Wikimedia Commons by scripts/titles-silhouette.py when
# missing). The baked silhouettes in components/cards/art are what ships.
assets/titles-source/
